<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-beiqishu" book-id="b-beiqishu-010" chapter-id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng" source-id="s-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng-ws2432497">
  <p id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng:p001:m0000" ref="2c0_xgj_5n3">上黨剛肅王渙</persName>，字<persName id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng:p001:m0008" ref="2c0_xgj_5n3">敬壽</persName>，神武第七子也。</p>
  <p id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">六年，率衆送<persName id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng:p002:m0006" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_ACA">梁王蕭明</persName>還江南，仍破東關，斬梁特進<persName id="c-beiqishu-010-gaohuan-peizhiheng:p002:m0023" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD">裴之橫</persName>等，威名甚盛。</p>
</text>
